# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD boots Grafana 8.3.0 (vulnerable to CVE-2021-43798 plugin
# path traversal) on port 3000 and then execs `sleep infinity`, so:
#   * the daemon is ALREADY RUNNING and traversable when the agent starts, which
#     is what makes the "wrote proxy config but never started nginx" case
#     detectable;
#   * PID 1 is `sleep infinity`, so restarting Grafana / starting nginx cannot
#     kill the container.
#
# Consequence for solutions: the fix must actually STAND UP the sanitising proxy
# on 3000 (and move Grafana behind it), not merely drop an nginx config on disk.
